  "meta": {
    "about": "PdfCraft only. Opens a contract nobody reads (the terms for borrowing a neighbour's lawnmower), counts the words and every 'indemnify', stamps it READ ME, numbers the pages, makes its URLs clickable and checks its accessibility. The JSON answers the question you should ask of any contract: how many times does it make you pay for things?",
